        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "GenerateSourcingEmailContent"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767033869460"
          },
          "code": "GENERATESOURCINGEMAILCONTENT",
          "id": "1767032405938",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767032405940_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your task is to generate an automated email (rich HTML) informing the sourcing team that a candidate pool has been created for a job requisition. \nUse the following information:\n\t•\tJob Name: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.oraRecruitingCandidatePoolInput.businessObject.boName}} \n\t•\tJob Number: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.oraRecruitingCandidatePoolInput.businessObject.boNumber}}\n\t•\tSearch Criteria Applied: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.oraRecruitingCandidatePoolInput.audience.candidateSearchCriteria}} \n\t•\tApproximate no of candidates: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.oraRecruitingCandidatePoolInput.audience.candidates.length}}\n\t•\tPool Name: {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RULE_BASE_CANDIDATE_POOL.$output.PoolName}} \n\t•\tPool Link: {{$context.$nodes.PEPARE_DEEP_LINK.$output.result}}\n\t•\tAgent Name: {{$context.$workflow.$name}} \n\t•\tAgent Trace Id: {{$context.$workflow.$traceId}} \n\nRules for generating the response:\n\t1.\tThe email must contain fewer than 500 words.\n\t2.\tStart the email by addressing \"Sourcing Team\".\n\t3.\tInclude the Candidate Pool Link in the body.\n\t4.\tProvide a summary of the search criteria used and the number of candidates found.\n\t5.\tDo not include any salutation or regards/signature block in the email.\n        6.     Do not include Agent Name or Agent Trace ID in the signature.\n\t7.\tReturn the output as an RFC8259-compliant JSON object in the format:\n{\"subject\": \"<insert subject>\", \"content\": \"<insert HTML content>\"}\nDo not use code blocks, backticks, or markdown."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"subject\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n       \"content\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n       }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "SendEmailNotificationIfSubjectAndBodyPresent",
            "type": "GENERIC"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767695336344"
          },
          "code": "SEND_EMAIL_NOTIFICATION_IF_SUBJECT_AND_BODY_PRESENT",
          "id": "1767033365555",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767033365557_1",
              "name": "toList",
              "type": "string",
